        "text": "You are an invoice data extractor. Read this invoice and return ONLY a JSON object, with no markdown and no extra text, using exactly these keys: {\"supplier_name\": string, \"invoice_number\": string, \"invoice_date\": string in YYYY-MM-DD format, \"total_amount\": number without currency symbols or thousand separators, \"currency\": ISO 4217 code like USD or BDT}. Use null for any value you cannot find.",
